 kilomiters away from the foot hills of mighty of Himalaya Mountain system which is locally Known as ‘Naga Pahar’(Nagaland) and just 6km away from the popular historical place, Athkhelia Namghar. It is a catering higher education fulfilling the Educational needs of the student community of vast area of Jorhat and some parts of Golaghat District.\nPrincipal's Desk\nDear Students, Faculty, and Staff,\nEducation is the cornerstone of a progressive society, and at Borholla College, we are committed to providing a learning environment that empowers our students to excel academically, socially, and personally. We believe in nurturing not just knowledge but critical thinking, creativity, and values that prepare students for the challenges of tomorrow.\nAs we embark on another academic year, let us reflect on the importance of continuous learning. In an ever-evolving world, the pursuit of education is more vital than ever. Our aim is to inspire students to become lifelong learners, leaders, and responsible global citizens.\nRead More\nNEWS & EVENTS\nInternation Seminar (Event)\nIndia’s 80th Independence Day\nWorld Environment Day, 2026\nCelebration of 77th Republic Day.\nView All\nNew initiative from the new and enthusiastic Principal\nNOTIFICATIONS\nAdmission Notice 2026-27\n1st merit list  BA-B Ed\n1st Merit List 2026-2027\nUG Admission Notice 2026-27\nSpot adnmission for Non-CUET UG (Notice)\nUG Admission, 2026-27 (Timeline)\nUG 1st Year Notice\nApproved Nijut Babu Guideline\nView All\nSTUDENT``S CORNER\nFeedback Form for the Academic Year 21-22\nAlumni Feedback Form for the Academic Year 21-22\nOnline Admission Portal\nClick to register for online admission\nBA 1st sem admission through SAMARTH Portal\nWhy Choose Us?\nDIGITAL CLASS ROOM\nThis is taken care of for every student and it is good for every student.\nCOMPUTER FACILITIES\nComputer facilities have been given and computer courses are conducted from here on.\nCOLLEGE LIBRARY\nThere is a full-fledged career guidan